{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"歷代志上","commonName":"歷代志上","title":"歷代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"2f94c34a21c96afb2fa5dd31e916ecbe47a93a65b505dad02727f81d295816f4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":938},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["眾人把上帝的約櫃抬進去，安放在大衛所搭的帳幕裡，然後在上帝面前獻上燔祭和平安祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["大衛獻上燔祭和平安祭後，就奉耶和華的名給民眾祝福，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["又給所有以色列人，不論男女，每人一個餅、一塊肉和一個葡萄餅。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["大衛指派一些利未人在耶和華的約櫃前事奉，頌揚、稱謝和讚美以色列的上帝耶和華。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["為首的是亞薩，其次是撒迦利雅、雅薛、示米拉末、耶歇、瑪他提雅、以利押、比拿雅、俄別·以東和耶利，他們鼓瑟彈琴，亞薩敲鈸。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["比拿雅和雅哈悉兩位祭司在上帝的約櫃前吹號。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["大衛的頌歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["那一天，大衛初次指派亞薩和他的親族唱詩歌頌耶和華，說："]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「你們要稱謝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"呼求祂的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在列邦傳揚祂的作為。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要歌頌、讚美祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"述說祂一切奇妙的作為。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要以祂的聖名為榮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願尋求耶和華的人心中快樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要尋求耶和華和祂的能力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"時常來到祂面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂僕人以色列的後裔啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂所揀選的雅各的子孫啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要記住祂所行的神蹟奇事和祂口中的判詞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"「祂是我們的上帝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂在普天下施行審判。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要永遠銘記祂的約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歷經千代也不可忘記祂的應許，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是祂與亞伯拉罕所立的約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向以撒所起的誓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂將這約定為律例賜給雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"定為永遠的約賜給以色列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂說，『我必把迦南賜給你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作為你的產業。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"「那時他們人丁稀少，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寥寥可數，在當地寄居，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在異國他鄉流離飄零。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華不容人壓迫他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"還為他們的緣故責備君王，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說，『不可加害我膏立的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不可傷害我的先知。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"「普世都要歌頌耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天天傳揚祂的救恩；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要在列國述說祂的榮耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在萬民中述說祂的奇妙作為。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華無比偉大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當受至高的頌揚；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂超越一切神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當受敬畏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列邦的神明都是假的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯獨耶和華創造了諸天。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂帶著尊貴和威嚴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的聖所充滿能力和喜樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"「萬族萬民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要把榮耀和能力歸給耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歸給耶和華！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要將耶和華之名當得的榮耀歸給祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要將供物獻給祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要穿聖衣敬拜耶和華","poem":1},{"noteId":9},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地要在祂面前顫抖；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世界堅立不搖。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願天歡喜，願地快樂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們在列國宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『耶和華執掌王權！』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願海洋和其中的萬物都歡呼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願田野和其中的一切都歡騰！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，林中的樹木都要在耶和華面前歡唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂要來審判天下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要稱謝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂是美善的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的慈愛永遠長存！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"text":"「要說，『拯救我們的上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你拯救我們，招聚我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我們從列國中救出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們好稱謝你的聖名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以讚美你為榮。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的上帝耶和華永永遠遠當受稱頌！」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾民都說：「阿們！」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並讚美耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["分派事奉的人員"]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":["大衛派亞薩及其親族天天在約櫃前事奉耶和華，盡當盡的職分；"]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":["又派俄別·以東及其六十八位親族、何薩和耶杜頓的兒子俄別·以東守門；"]},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":["並派祭司撒督及其他祭司在基遍邱壇的耶和華的聖幕前供職，"]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":["按照耶和華在律法書上對以色列人的吩咐，每日早晚在祭壇上獻燔祭給耶和華。"]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":["與他們一同供職的有希幔、耶杜頓和其他人，他們被特別選出來稱謝上帝，因為祂的慈愛永遠長存。"]},{"type":"verse","number":42,"content":["希幔和耶杜頓負責用號、鈸及其他樂器伴奏歌頌上帝。耶杜頓的子孫負責守門。"]},{"type":"verse","number":43,"content":["於是，眾民各自回家，大衛也回去為家人祝福。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"或譯「要敬拜聖潔榮耀的耶和華」。","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":29}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":42}